SPIRIT OF ADVENTURE (UNREGISTER) 1.2  INSTALLATION
SPIRIT OF ADVENTURE ©1994

NOTICE!! READ THIS!!
If you are already running the older version of Spirit of Adventure
(Unregistered).  Simply Uncompact the new version into the Pfiles
directory.  It should copy over all the old files, however, it will keep
your players directory intact!  It may ask you if you want to copy over
some of the files in there, answer YES.

1. Uncompact the SOA.lha archive directly into your Pfiles: directory
	The following should uncompact:
		...SOAUNREG (DRAWER)
		...SOA.UNREG2 (MAIN CODE)
		...UPDATE.UNREG (CHARACTER UPDATER)

	The SOAUNREG (DRAWER) should contain the following:
		...CITYPICS (DRAWER)
		...DOCS (DRAWER)
		...DUNGEONPICS (DRAWER)
		...DUNGEONS (DRAWER)
		...DUNGEONTEXT (DRAWER)
		...GUIPICS (DRAWER)
		...MONSTERPICS (DRAWER)
		..PLAYERPICS (DRAWER)
		...PLAYERS (DRAWER) <-if not here, it will create it
			...CITYITEMS
			...CITYMONSTERS
			...COMMANDS
			...CONJURERSPELLS
			...ENDING.PIC
			...GARTHSTORE
			...INSTRUCTIONMENU
			...MAGICIANSPELLS
			...MONSTERS
			...RUMORS
			...SEWEW1MONSTERS
			...SEWER1ITEMS
			...SORCERERSPELLS
			...TITLE.PIC
			...TOWN
			...WIZARDSPELLS
> END OF ARCHIVE

2. Once you have uncompacted the above into your pfiles: directory you may
then start adopting them into your pfiles: area.

	Adopt SOA.UNREG2
		DISABLE MORE? YES
		DISABLE WORD-WRAP? YES
		ONE USER AT A TIME? YES

	Adopt UPDATE.UNREG
		ACCESS GROUP 31

3. IMPORTANT! If you are running Spirit of Adventure for the first-time, or
there are currently no players, or you wish to reset the game, then it is
not necessary to run the UPDATE.UNREG program.  However, if you are not
going to run the UPDATE.UNREG and you are running a older version of Spirit
of Adventure, then empty your players directory in the SOAUNREG directory.

If you are running Spirit of Adventure, and wish to update to this version
while keeping all the players, it is necessary to run the UPDATE.UNREG
program through Cnet.

4. Load SOA.UNREG2 into your favorite text editor.  At the very beginning
of the program you will see some things you can tinker with.  Put in your
BBS name, you can set the difficulty level and select the number of turns
per day.  If you do wish to make any changes to Spirit of Adventure, please
contact me.  If you make changes to Spirit of Adventure without my
permission, then you are in violation of my copyright.


